## **Pro Tier: Should It Exist?**

Yes — with one critical constraint. The Pro tier exists to filter highest-intent operators, not to generate primary revenue. It should never be the main pitch. When a prospect signs up for Pro, that is a behavioral signal that they will pay for a solution. That signal triggers personal outreach within 48 hours for a discovery call. The Pro subscription is the qualification mechanism — not the product.

 

