| Form LLC (Florida) + open business bank account | Legal entity active | Done / Not done |
| Hire attorney: draft BAA, DPA, MSA, AUP templates | Contract templates ready | Templates reviewed |
| Notify insurer: commercial equipment rider (if hardware is being deployed) | Insurance confirmation in writing | Written confirmation |
| Build 1-page landing page: positioning, 3 pricing tiers, contact form | Live URL | Page live |
| Build 'Law Brief' free tool: intake summary / case chronology generator | Free tool live and functional | Tool generates output |
| Identify 30 target law firms in Broward/Miami-Dade via Florida Bar directory | Prospect list with contact info | 30 qualified contacts |
| Begin B2B outreach — Heppner angle for law firms, HIPAA angle for dental | Personalized emails sent | 30 contacts reached |
| Join 2 South Florida bar association or legal professional networks | Community presence established | 2 communities joined |

 

## **Days 31–60: First Clients**

| **Action** | **Deliverable** | **Success Metric** |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Run 8–12 discovery calls with law firm and dental prospects | Discovery call notes, pain maps | 5+ calls completed |
| Deliver 3+ retainer proposals — same day as discovery call | Written proposals delivered | 3 proposals delivered |
| Close minimum 2 onboarding clients — sign agreements, collect payment | Signed MSA + deposit paid | 2 clients signed |
| Deliver first onboarding — document every configuration step | Client workflows live + playbook draft | Workflows operational |
| Gate check: if 0 paying clients by Day 60, revisit positioning and outreach before any hardware spend | Go/no-go decision | Decision documented |

 

