| Deliver first monthly access report to each retainer client | Written monthly report | Reports delivered on time |
| Evaluate infrastructure: do any signed clients require private endpoints? If yes, initiate hardware or colo procurement. | Infrastructure decision document | Decision made and documented |
| Begin dental vertical outreach — recall automation angle | 10 dental prospects contacted | 2+ discovery calls booked |
| Document law firm playbook from first onboarding | Written onboarding playbook v1 | Playbook complete |
| Pursue case study rights from first client | Written or video case study | Case study asset ready |

 

